Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before modifying the repository.

Key reminders:

- Git HEAD and canonical documents are the source of truth.
- Use one coding agent in the active working tree at a time.
- Preserve unrelated user changes.
- Do not push, merge, rewrite history, or delete branches unless explicitly authorized.
- Read the explicitly named `.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md` file before executing a matching workflow.
- Keep implementation focused; do not add speculative systems.
- Report exact verification evidence.
